# Pack intake (agents)

When adding or amending a tariff **data pack**, CSMS/FR wiring, HTS list, or stacking golden:

1. Follow **[`tariff-rules/docs/PACK_INTAKE.md`](tariff-rules/docs/PACK_INTAKE.md)** end-to-end.
2. A pack exists only after authority names **Ch.99 headings + HTS list (or claim rule) + effective date**.
3. Prefer **list diffs** (attachment vs JSON) over model memory of coverage.
4. Never invent off-list 232/301 from UI fields alone (e.g. metal content on HTS not on Metals List).
5. Update together: pack `source_csms` / `as_of`, engine, goldens, `RULES.md` worked example, `program_watch` / `program_status`.
6. Mark EXPIRED programs (`do_not_compute`) — do not resurrect CSPV/washer 201 headings for solar.
7. Fill the intake PR block in PACK_INTAKE.md; fail the weekly scorecard → treat as incomplete.

Broker disputes: capture tool vs expected stack + CSMS cite → golden → pack or invent fix.
